    "body": "Proposed agenda:\r\n\r\n1. https://open-ui.org/components/selectlist/ 5-10 minutes for Joey Arhar to present some background, use cases and current status of customizable `<select>`\r\n\r\n2. https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/5998 New appearance property value for interoperable and styleable form control elements\r\n\r\n3. https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10028 Changing UA styles based on the computed value of the appearance property\r\n\r\n4. https://github.com/w3c/csswg-drafts/issues/10242 How to implement the `<selectedoption>` element\r\n\r\n5. https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9841 InvokeTarget attribute for popover and dialog\r\n\r\n6. https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/9778 Popover=hint behavior",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
